  - At: 0
    Headline: EMERGENCY BROADCAST
    Detail: A MESSAGE FROM THE STATE POLICE
  - At: 18
    Headline: VIRUS OUTBREAK CONFIRMED
    Detail: HIGHLY CONTAGIOUS - SPREADING FAST
  - At: 24
    Headline: IT STARTED IN THE HOSPITALS
    Detail: TWO COUNTY HOSPITALS NAMED
  - At: 29
    Headline: 'SYMPTOMS: CONFUSION, COLLAPSE'
    Detail: LOSS OF COORDINATION - THEN DEATH
  - At: 37
    Headline: THE INFECTED ARE VIOLENT
    Detail: DO NOT APPROACH THE SICK
  - At: 42
    Headline: AVOID ANYONE WITH SYMPTOMS
    Detail: DO NOT TRY TO HELP THEM
  - At: 46
    Headline: COUNTIES UNDER QUARANTINE
    Detail: UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE
  - At: 51
    Headline: STAY IN YOUR HOMES
    Detail: LOCK YOUR DOORS - WAIT FOR NEWS
  - At: 58
    Headline: STAY TUNED
    Detail: FURTHER DETAILS TO FOLLOW
  tickerLines:
  - HOSPITALS SEALED - DO NOT ENTER OR LEAVE
  - NATIONAL GUARD SENT TO QUARANTINE ZONE
  - PHONE NETWORKS DOWN - USE TEXT ONLY
  - ATTACKS REPORTED AT COUNTY GENERAL
  - ALL ROADS OUT OF THE CITY CLOSED
  - DO NOT TAKE THE SICK TO A HOSPITAL
